# BEANSHEAL StockTrace — Project Overview

액상 건기식 OEM/ODM **고객 홈페이지** + 사내 **생산 ERP** 통합 앱 (Next.js 15 App Router).

## Two surfaces

| Surface | Entry | Stack |
|---------|-------|-------|
| Customer site | `/` → middleware rewrites to `public/homepage.html` | Static HTML + `public/css/styles.css` + `public/js/app.js` |
| Internal ERP | `/login`, `/workspace`, `/orders`, `/inventory`, … | Next.js + Tailwind + Supabase + Server Actions |

## Layout split (`LayoutContent.tsx`)

- **Full-width** (no Sidebar): `/`, `/login`
- **ERP shell** (Sidebar + `bg-slate-100`): all other routes under `src/app/(workspace)/`

## Key integrations

- **Supabase**: auth, recipes, production orders, inventory, CMS data — client `@/lib/supabase`, actions in `src/app/actions/`
- **Notion**: production calendar sync — `notionActions.ts`
- **Ecount**: stock scraping/API — `ecount.ts`, `scripts/ecountBot.ts`
- **Brand assets**: wordmark `public/images/beansheal-logo.png`, favicon `public/favicon.ico`

## Do not break

- `/` must stay customer homepage (rewrite or iframe), not ERP dashboard.
- ERP dashboard lives at `/workspace`, not `/`.
- Logo link in Sidebar → `/workspace`.
